{"id":"c61fe71286984490","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-isigma-hierarchy.md","title":"Arithmetic Theories $I\\Sigma n$","display":"df-isigma-hierarchy — Arithmetic Theories $I\\Sigma_n$","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-isigma-hierarchy","aliases":["90-df-isigma-hierarchy"],"display":"df-isigma-hierarchy — Arithmetic Theories $I\\Sigma_n$","depends_on":["[[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[90-df-formula]]","[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]","[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","[[90-df-peano-arithmetic]]","[[90-df-syntax-interface]]","[[90-df-free-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-isigma-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-isigma-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-isigma-hierarchy — Arithmetic Theories <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\Sigma_n\">\\(I\\Sigma_n\\)</span>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b7d7a03ff76428de\" href=\"?note=b7d7a03ff76428de\" title=\"90-df-robinson-arithmetic\">90-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4c3a40ac2277e7d0\" href=\"?note=4c3a40ac2277e7d0\" title=\"90-df-peano-arithmetic\">90-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5385f3fe07cb98ef\" href=\"?note=5385f3fe07cb98ef\" title=\"90-df-free-variable\">90-df-free-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> 及对象语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le\">\\(\\le\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a>；变量、项、公式、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Distinct}\">\\(\\mathrm{Distinct}\\)</span>、有限量词列及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}\">\\(\\operatorname{var}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"5385f3fe07cb98ef\" href=\"?note=5385f3fe07cb98ef\" title=\"90-df-free-variable\">90-df-free-variable</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q,PA,\\mathrm{IndAx}_x\">\\(Q,PA,\\mathrm{IndAx}_x\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"b7d7a03ff76428de\" href=\"?note=b7d7a03ff76428de\" title=\"90-df-robinson-arithmetic\">90-df-robinson-arithmetic</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"4c3a40ac2277e7d0\" href=\"?note=4c3a40ac2277e7d0\" title=\"90-df-peano-arithmetic\">90-df-peano-arithmetic</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\">\\(+\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\mathrm{FOL}_{=}}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\mathrm{FOL}_{=}}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\">\\(u\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\">\\(t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\notin\\operatorname{var}(t)\">\\(u\\notin\\operatorname{var}(t)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\">\\(\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\)</span>。下式先生成有界量词的展开公式，再取类闭包；不以展开后所有量词均显式有界作为成员判据。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BClosed}\">\\(\\mathrm{BClosed}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedQ}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedQ}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{pn}\">\\(\\mathrm{pn}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\Sigma_n\">\\(I\\Sigma_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PA\">\\(PA\\)</span> 是证明呈示；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigvee^{\\mathrm{pres}}\">\\(\\bigvee^{\\mathrm{pres}}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a> 的同语言呈示并。其第二分量是全部逻辑公理与各级非逻辑公理的并。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n(\\exists u\\le t)\\psi&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists u(u\\le t\\land\\psi),\\\\\n(\\forall u\\le t)\\psi&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall u(u\\le t\\to\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{BClosed}(X)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n&amp;X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\land\\mathrm{AtFml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\subseteq X\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall\\varphi\\in X\\ (\\neg\\varphi)\\in X)\n\\land(\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in X\\ (\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\in X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\psi\\in X\\ \\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\\n\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\ \\Bigl[u\\notin\\operatorname{var}(t)\\Longrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10em}((\\exists u\\le t)\\psi)\\in X\\land((\\forall u\\le t)\\psi)\\in X\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathcal B&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}:\\mathrm{BClosed}(X)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{BoundedQ}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(\\varphi)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\varphi\\in\\mathcal B.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n(\\exists u\\le t)\\psi&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists u(u\\le t\\land\\psi),\\\\\n(\\forall u\\le t)\\psi&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall u(u\\le t\\to\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{BClosed}(X)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n&amp;X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\land\\mathrm{AtFml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\subseteq X\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall\\varphi\\in X\\ (\\neg\\varphi)\\in X)\n\\land(\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in X\\ (\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\in X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\psi\\in X\\ \\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\\n\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\ \\Bigl[u\\notin\\operatorname{var}(t)\\Longrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10em}((\\exists u\\le t)\\psi)\\in X\\land((\\forall u\\le t)\\psi)\\in X\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathcal B&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}:\\mathrm{BClosed}(X)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{BoundedQ}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(\\varphi)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\varphi\\in\\mathcal B.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Sigma_0^{\\mathrm{pn}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal B,\\qquad\\Pi_0^{\\mathrm{pn}}\\coloneqq\\mathcal B,\\\\\n\\Sigma_{n+1}^{\\mathrm{pn}}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\exists\\vec u\\,\\psi:\\psi\\in\\Pi_n^{\\mathrm{pn}}\\land\\mathrm{Distinct}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(\\vec u)\\},\\\\\n\\Pi_{n+1}^{\\mathrm{pn}}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\forall\\vec u\\,\\psi:\\psi\\in\\Sigma_n^{\\mathrm{pn}}\\land\\mathrm{Distinct}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(\\vec u)\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma_n&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}:\\exists\\psi\\in\\Sigma_n^{\\mathrm{pn}}\\\n\\varphi\\equiv_{\\mathrm{FOL}_{=}}\\psi\\},\\\\\n\\Pi_n&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}:\\exists\\psi\\in\\Pi_n^{\\mathrm{pn}}\\\n\\varphi\\equiv_{\\mathrm{FOL}_{=}}\\psi\\},\\\\\nI\\Sigma_n&amp;\\coloneqq Q+\\{\\mathrm{IndAx}_x(\\varphi):\n\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_n\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\},\\\\\nI\\Sigma_\\omega&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathop{\\bigvee}\\limits^{\\mathrm{pres}}_{n\\in\\mathbb N}I\\Sigma_n,\\qquad I\\Sigma_\\omega=PA.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\Sigma_0^{\\mathrm{pn}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal B,\\qquad\\Pi_0^{\\mathrm{pn}}\\coloneqq\\mathcal B,\\\\\n\\Sigma_{n+1}^{\\mathrm{pn}}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\exists\\vec u\\,\\psi:\\psi\\in\\Pi_n^{\\mathrm{pn}}\\land\\mathrm{Distinct}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(\\vec u)\\},\\\\\n\\Pi_{n+1}^{\\mathrm{pn}}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\forall\\vec u\\,\\psi:\\psi\\in\\Sigma_n^{\\mathrm{pn}}\\land\\mathrm{Distinct}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(\\vec u)\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma_n&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}:\\exists\\psi\\in\\Sigma_n^{\\mathrm{pn}}\\\n\\varphi\\equiv_{\\mathrm{FOL}_{=}}\\psi\\},\\\\\n\\Pi_n&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}:\\exists\\psi\\in\\Pi_n^{\\mathrm{pn}}\\\n\\varphi\\equiv_{\\mathrm{FOL}_{=}}\\psi\\},\\\\\nI\\Sigma_n&amp;\\coloneqq Q+\\{\\mathrm{IndAx}_x(\\varphi):\n\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_n\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\},\\\\\nI\\Sigma_\\omega&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathop{\\bigvee}\\limits^{\\mathrm{pres}}_{n\\in\\mathbb N}I\\Sigma_n,\\qquad I\\Sigma_\\omega=PA.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留按纯一阶逻辑等价闭包而不是按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>-可证等价闭包的原约定。量词列允许为空；原子矩阵也允许无有界量词。每个有限公式都可作捕获避免的前束化，并通过空块补齐为某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^{\\mathrm{pn}}\">\\(\\Sigma_n^{\\mathrm{pn}}\\)</span>，故最后的公理集并等式成立。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedQ}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedQ}\\)</span> 和逻辑等价现在均有实际定义来源。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d7a03ff76428de","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"278a6c2cfc6160a3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"4c3a40ac2277e7d0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-s