splay":false},{"tex":"PA","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigvee^{\\mathrm{pres}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n(\\exists u\\le t)\\psi&\\coloneqq\\exists u(u\\le t\\land\\psi),\\\\\n(\\forall u\\le t)\\psi&\\coloneqq\\forall u(u\\le t\\to\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{BClosed}(X)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n&X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\land\\mathrm{AtFml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\subseteq X\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall\\varphi\\in X\\ (\\neg\\varphi)\\in X)\n\\land(\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in X\\ (\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\in X)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\psi\\in X\\ \\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\\n\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\ \\Bigl[u\\notin\\operatorname{var}(t)\\Longrightarrow\\\\\n&\\hspace{10em}((\\exists u\\le t)\\psi)\\in X\\land((\\forall u\\le t)\\psi)\\in X\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathcal B&\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}:\\mathrm{BClosed}(X)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{BoundedQ}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(\\varphi)&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\varphi\\in\\mathcal B.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Sigma_0^{\\mathrm{pn}}&\\coloneqq\\mathcal B,\\qquad\\Pi_0^{\\mathrm{pn}}\\coloneqq\\mathcal B,\\\\\n\\Sigma_{n+1}^{\\mathrm{pn}}&\\coloneqq\n\\{\\exists\\vec u\\,\\psi:\\psi\\in\\Pi_n^{\\mathrm{pn}}\\land\\mathrm{Distinct}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(\\vec u)\\},\\\\\n\\Pi_{n+1}^{\\mathrm{pn}}&\\coloneqq\n\\{\\forall\\vec u\\,\\psi:\\psi\\in\\Sigma_n^{\\mathrm{pn}}\\land\\mathrm{Distinct}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(\\vec u)\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma_n&\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}:\\exists\\psi\\in\\Sigma_n^{\\mathrm{pn}}\\\n\\varphi\\equiv_{\\mathrm{FOL}_{=}}\\psi\\},\\\\\n\\Pi_n&\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}:\\exists\\psi\\in\\Pi_n^{\\mathrm{pn}}\\\n\\varphi\\equiv_{\\mathrm{FOL}_{=}}\\psi\\},\\\\\nI\\Sigma_n&\\coloneqq Q+\\{\\mathrm{IndAx}_x(\\varphi):\n\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_n\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\},\\\\\nI\\Sigma_\\omega&\\coloneqq\\mathop{\\bigvee}\\limits^{\\mathrm{pres}}_{n\\in\\mathbb N}I\\Sigma_n,\\qquad I\\Sigma_\\omega=PA.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n^{\\mathrm{pn}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedQ}","display":false}],"bytes":3918,"backlinks":[{"id":"c0383e348990de99","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}$ (arithmetical $\\Sigma_1$ sentences, see [[90-df-isigma-hierarchy]])"},{"id":"4c3a40ac2277e7d0","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"保留允许参数的一阶归纳模式。参数顺序及参数集合不再依赖临时约定，所以 $\\mathrm{IndAx}_x$ 真正是由输入公式确定的函数。该公式映射也可在算术的扩张签名上使用，供 $PRA$ 调用；$PA$ 自身仍只取原算术语言的全部公式。$I\\Sigma_\\omega$ 的别名和并集性质在 [[90-df-isigma-hierarchy]] 中给出。"},{"id":"8c071ce52fa72de0","anchor":"ref-32","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Represents}_Q$、$Q$、$\\Sigma_1$、$\\mathbb N_{\\mathrm{arith}}$ 分别见 [[90-df-representation]]、[[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]]、[[90-df-isigma-hierarchy]]、[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]。表示公式存在性见 [[90-df-representability-theorem]]。$p,n,s,i\\in\\mathbb N$。"},{"id":"31a1cb59fb59977d","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{Rec}_k,\\mathrm{RecPred}_k$、$\\mathrm{Represents}$ 及 $\\Sigma_1$ 分别见 [[90-df-recursive-function-class]]、[[90-df-representation]]、[[90-df-isigma-hierarchy]]。"},{"id":"5a383d3d0b123595","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-58","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]]、[[90-df-peano-arithmetic]]、[[90-df-isigma-hierarchy]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-47","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addition-function.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetic-language.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[90-df-berry-paradox.md]]\n[[90-df-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-df-closure-o